WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
In simulation, a humanoid stands beside a yellow box suspended from an overhead cable. A rectangular landing platform is directly below the box.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The humanoid reaches toward the suspended box as the cable lowers it toward the platform.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The humanoid's hands guide the descending load. This view is cropped from the HOIST panel of the authors' comparative simulation video.
